Hooray for ascension #2!  After a successful go with a Valk, I switched
sides to the spellcaster.  After a number of deaths, I learned the hard
way...  Elbereth may be boring, but it's your friend.  Points of note:

- Mines were at DL4, so continued down and found a co-aligned altar at
DL6; got Magicbane
- Found an "reflection as random treasure (one of three total) on the
way to Sokoban
- Got the BoH at Sokoban
- Found a /wishing in the Big Room! Kitted up with magic marker, SDSM,
[brilliance, [dexterity, [jumping and boosted reasonably
- Found a magic lamp around DL15 - Extra magic marker, scribed a bunch
of genocide
- Made a smashing entrance to the castle with wands; unfortunately
someone zapped /cold across the moat and I had to fall back on Elbereth
a couple of times (no =3Dconflict yet)
- Nurse dancing in a Sokoban boulder-fort
- Made quick work of the quest, VotD, Gehennom, Vlad, and Rodney's
tower (XL23)
- Sacrifest to try and get +FD (separate thread, thanks again
everyone); finally managed it (and a =3Dconflict) with help from +poly
- Levelled up to XL30 thanks to a pair of incubi (and a helpful nurse
who showed up to join in the fun)
- Learned how much fun teleport is! The longest part about getting from
Rodney's tower to the VS was having to walk down 2 levels from Vlad's
instead of 1 due to restricted teleport.
- Blasted through the Sanctum with conflict and magic missiles
- Rodney II around DL25, fingered
- Rodney III on Earth as expected, fingered (so much fun!)
- Rodney IV on Air, fingered (took forever on Air, forgot to Haste
Self)
- Traipsed across Astral with =3Dconflict, jumping, magic missile, and
the wand of death

